{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "8ca0261e-ae14-5be3-bdfc-a55c82eed4e8", "source_ordinal": 1449, "reading_ordinal": 2608, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "牙关紧咬", "published_at": "2024-07-21T17:29:39+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/654670442/answer/3568905321"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "对话分析什么的最萌了。我们来看看下面这个对话。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 23}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "quote", "index": 2, "text": "吃饭的时候我看他没吃，就体贴问他“怎么不吃啊，多吃点呀，不然饿。”他:我吃差不多了", "char_start": 25, "char_end": 66}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "第一回合，这个话已经说错了。如果你要问不吃的原因，就要止步于“怎么不吃呀”，后面就不该加上“多吃点呀，不然饿”。加了，你前面的问题就是一个没有诚意的问题。问没有诚意的问题，就是在浪费对方的思考资源，本身就是一种霸凌行为，一开始就已经毒化了对话的基调。", "char_start": 67, "char_end": 192}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "第一步迈出去，就已经决定了这个对话只是一种刻意伪装的强制。而在所有的强制之中，刻意伪装的强制是一种懦弱的强制，是最糟糕的强制之一。", "char_start": 193, "char_end": 258}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "是命令，就要清晰的用命令语气，直接说“多吃点”。", "char_start": 259, "char_end": 283}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "你要温柔，可以说“请吃完”，说“谢谢你，请吃完”，但不能说“能不能请你吃完？”“你要不要多吃点？”", "char_start": 284, "char_end": 333}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "你问，就是真的问，就是真的允许ta选，ta选了你就不能多话。你不允许ta选，就不要逃避自己的压力，假装去用询问句。", "char_start": 334, "char_end": 391}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "你要这么干，只会同时毁坏这两种工具的严肃性和有效性，搞得以后你下命令ta也觉得可以商量，用询问ta也觉得是被强制。", "char_start": 392, "char_end": 449}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "这其实是一种沟通信用，你不守，你就没信用。", "char_start": 450, "char_end": 471}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "一旦你没了沟通信用，只要你开口发起对话，对方就会暴躁。", "char_start": 472, "char_end": 499}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "很多父母奇怪子女为什么如此“一触即跳”，在抱怨“我还啥都没说”，觉得冤屈，是因为ta们在错误的套用陌生人对话的逻辑——即对话的信用总是从本场对话开始计算，要丧失对话信用必须在本次对话里说出什么错话，如果本次对话里还没说出什么错话，对方就不应该脱离友好对话的礼仪。所以就这当前对话而言，我还什么都没说，你凭啥不耐烦？", "char_start": 500, "char_end": 657}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "殊不知你们的对话不是陌生人对话，你的对话信用早已在之前若干年里的胡乱混用之中丧失殆尽了，你的起点远比陌生人低，你是以一个信用早已破产的人的身份在申请开启对话。", "char_start": 658, "char_end": 737}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "在这个前提下，你仅仅只是毫无意识的再次搞这种混用，你都是在0分基础上再扣成负分。", "char_start": 738, "char_end": 778}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "所以这个对话第一句就已经说错了。", "char_start": 779, "char_end": 795}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "quote", "index": 15, "text": "我:肯定会饿的，你再多吃点他:我吃差不多了", "char_start": 796, "char_end": 817}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "再一次的，你在混用劝说与命令。", "char_start": 818, "char_end": 833}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "这仍然是懦弱的管理。这也是这个时代所谓的“平等理念”的流毒。父母与子女根本不是“平等”的实体，而是无可回避的上下级关系。父母必须坚定的领导和管理，承担领导和管理的压力和责任。不少父母恐惧这样的压力和责任，总是无谓的想要少下命令，猥琐的、懦弱的甚至是卑鄙的采用种种自以为巧妙的“智慧”要把自己的命令伪装成、捏造成子女的“自愿选择”。", "char_start": 834, "char_end": 999}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "明明自己想要，偏要摆出一种“任君选择”的架势，选得不如ta的意，要么就要翻脸，要么就要“劝说”。", "char_start": 1000, "char_end": 1048}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "说到底为了什么？", "char_start": 1049, "char_end": 1057}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "为了既保证子女按自己说的做，又可以在结果糟糕时脑补自己责任没那么大，是子女自己选的、自己自愿的，都是天意。", "char_start": 1058, "char_end": 1111}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "还可以在跟一群家长交流育儿起经验时高兴的宣布“我们家很民主，我跟孩子很平等”，因为这个圈子里流行这种“共识”。这么干可以从这种“群体认可”中汲取某种自信，对抗自己的忐忑和迷茫。", "char_start": 1112, "char_end": 1200}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "这种“伪装的选择未能如愿后的全方位劝说”就是这种“伪自由“的经典实践。", "char_start": 1201, "char_end": 1236}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "这做法其实是对子女基本心智的一种反复的侮辱。如果是故意的侮辱倒也罢了，真正可悲的是父母对此还茫然无知，会觉得这么显然的愚蠢策略“理应有效”。", "char_start": 1237, "char_end": 1307}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "通过选择这样的愚蠢策略，反映出ta们真的认为子女就是这么愚蠢，这种侮辱才真的是深入骨髓。", "char_start": 1308, "char_end": 1352}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "所以这句话触怒子女之深，远超过傲慢的认为这种“ta们会吃这招”的父母的想象。", "char_start": 1353, "char_end": 1391}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "尤其是这句“你肯定会饿的”，傲慢溢于言表。", "char_start": 1392, "char_end": 1413}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "要确定无疑的断言“肯定会饿”，需要知道子女做过些什么，准备做什么，而且笃定自己的判断必然符合事实。", "char_start": 1414, "char_end": 1463}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "不管你自己自认为如何，子女很清楚你其实管不了。ta完全可以在离开你的视线后在楼下米粉店吃一碗，你根本干预不了也觉察不了。", "char_start": 1464, "char_end": 1524}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "而你对这一点如此笃定，就如同认定ta没有让你的断言失效的任何能力。", "char_start": 1525, "char_end": 1558}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "这又是一重侮辱。", "char_start": 1559, "char_end": 1567}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "quote", "index": 31, "text": "我:是不是觉得饭不好吃他:我吃差不多了", "char_start": 1569, "char_end": 1588}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "这话言下之意是ta是不可能凭着自己的意愿选择不吃的，一定是因为别的客观原因导致的。", "char_start": 1589, "char_end": 1630}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "只要解决了这个客观原因，ta的主观意志根本不成问题。", "char_start": 1631, "char_end": 1657}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "其实这个思路就跟“世界上没有忠臣烈女，只有不够高的价码”一样，属于蔑视人的人格尊严。", "char_start": 1658, "char_end": 1700}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "这个一翻手就是“只要我够好，没人会不喜欢我”，再一翻手就是“我对你不够好吗，ta到底哪里比我强，你为什么选ta不选我”。", "char_start": 1701, "char_end": 1761}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "ta比你哪点好？就是在“尊重我的选择”这一条上比你好，这一条就胜过了你全部的所谓客观优势。", "char_start": 1762, "char_end": 1807}, {"paragraph_id": "P037", "field": "body", "index": 37, "text": "什么叫“千金难买我乐意”？谁说你摆出千金，我就必须乐意？", "char_start": 1808, "char_end": 1836}, {"paragraph_id": "P038", "field": "body", "index": 38, "text": "谁说只要好吃，我就必须爱吃？", "char_start": 1837, "char_end": 1851}, {"paragraph_id": "P039", "field": "body", "index": 39, "text": "我是人，不是ph试纸。", "char_start": 1852, "char_end": 1863}, {"paragraph_id": "P040", "field": "body", "index": 40, "text": "自由意志的本质，是不可预测性。", "char_start": 1864, "char_end": 1879}, {"paragraph_id": "P041", "field": "body", "index": 41, "text": "断言我是可以预测的，按照对待有所谓习性的动物那样来对待我，就是不把我当人看。", "char_start": 1880, "char_end": 1918}, {"paragraph_id": "P042", "field": "quote", "index": 42, "text": "我:你下午肯定会饿，到时候怎么办？他:我吃差不多了", "char_start": 1920, "char_end": 1945}, {"paragraph_id": "P043", "field": "body", "index": 43, "text": "已经被回应过的问题，再次被重复提出，意味着我上次回复的效力被你无视了。", "char_start": 1946, "char_end": 1981}, {"paragraph_id": "P044", "field": "body", "index": 44, "text": "除非你引入什么新的信息、新的证据，否则这样赤裸裸的一案多审，岂不是一种下意识的“试图依赖疲劳战术屈打成招”？", "char_start": 1982, "char_end": 2036}, {"paragraph_id": "P045", "field": "body", "index": 45, "text": "这是违背对话伦理的。", "char_start": 2037, "char_end": 2047}, {"paragraph_id": "P046", "field": "quote", "index": 46, "text": "我:那你下午准备出去跟谁玩吗？要留着肚子？他:我吃差不多了", "char_start": 2049, "char_end": 2078}, {"paragraph_id": "P047", "field": "body", "index": 47, "text": "这又是换了一个路线，要换别的角度“劝说”。", "char_start": 2079, "char_end": 2100}, {"paragraph_id": "P048", "field": "body", "index": 48, "text": "而且还涉及到窥探隐私。", "char_start": 2101, "char_end": 2112}, {"paragraph_id": "P049", "field": "body", "index": 49, "text": "这个隐私问题是这样的，要么你没给ta这个不报备权，那么你现在这么问ta，就等于隐性的指控ta违规隐瞒实际行程，现在是被你抓住了马脚；要么你是给了ta这个不报备权，那么你现在就是超越了这个隐私界限。", "char_start": 2113, "char_end": 2211}, {"paragraph_id": "P050", "field": "body", "index": 50, "text": "两头都是错。", "char_start": 2212, "char_end": 2218}, {"paragraph_id": "P051", "field": "quote", "index": 51, "text": "之后我又问了大概十几句，他也就跟着回了十几句一模一样的“我吃差不多了”我崩溃了，躲在卧室里哭", "char_start": 2219, "char_end": 2265}, {"paragraph_id": "P052", "field": "body", "index": 52, "text": "这个“连问了十几句”，本质上只怕都是想要诱出一个原因来。只要ta给出了一个原因，你就会去解决掉这个原因，然后ta就没法不吃了，不是吗？", "char_start": 2266, "char_end": 2333}, {"paragraph_id": "P053", "field": "body", "index": 53, "text": "说来说去还是要堵死对方不屈从自己意志的一切客观因素。", "char_start": 2334, "char_end": 2360}, {"paragraph_id": "P054", "field": "body", "index": 54, "text": "问题是，ta仅仅凭着一句“不愿意”，就可以在一切客观理由都不成立的前提下保持不屈从。", "char_start": 2361, "char_end": 2403}, {"paragraph_id": "P055", "field": "body", "index": 55, "text": "你说得都对，唯独少了一条，那就是“我的不愿意如果不被接受，这比什么伤身体、亏钱……恶劣一万遍”。", "char_start": 2404, "char_end": 2452}, {"paragraph_id": "P056", "field": "body", "index": 56, "text": "是你在逼迫ta无视一切合理性，坚持主张不愿意。", "char_start": 2453, "char_end": 2476}, {"paragraph_id": "P057", "field": "body", "index": 57, "text": "是你在逼ta以伤身体、伤感情、亏钱、饥饿……为代价，换不愿意的有效性。", "char_start": 2477, "char_end": 2512}, {"paragraph_id": "P058", "field": "body", "index": 58, "text": "是你在做“一定要ta付出代价才能实现拒绝”的选择，而不是ta在选什么，因为ta必须选“不愿意就是不行”。", "char_start": 2513, "char_end": 2565}, {"paragraph_id": "P059", "field": "body", "index": 59, "text": "你要做一切的说服、引导，都必须以“你不愿意就等于不行”为前提，因为你不尊重这个前提，你就是个敌人，你就根本没有劝说的资格。", "char_start": 2566, "char_end": 2627}, {"paragraph_id": "P060", "field": "body", "index": 60, "text": "哪有人会听敌人的劝？", "char_start": 2628, "char_end": 2638}, {"paragraph_id": "P061", "field": "body", "index": 61, "text": "分析就分析到这里，再说说这个分析摆在你面前，你要怎么消化。", "char_start": 2639, "char_end": 2668}, {"paragraph_id": "P062", "field": "body", "index": 62, "text": "先说父母这一头。", "char_start": 2669, "char_end": 2677}, {"paragraph_id": "P063", "field": "body", "index": 63, "text": "先说这个对话可以怎么说：", "char_start": 2678, "char_end": 2690}, {"paragraph_id": "P064", "field": "body", "index": 64, "text": "—— 你好像没怎么吃，是吗？", "char_start": 2691, "char_end": 2705}, {"paragraph_id": "P065", "field": "body", "index": 65, "text": "—— 我吃得差不多了。", "char_start": 2706, "char_end": 2717}, {"paragraph_id": "P066", "field": "body", "index": 66, "text": "—— 我问的不是“你是不是吃得差不多了”我是问你“是不是没怎么吃”。你是不是没吃多少？", "char_start": 2719, "char_end": 2762}, {"paragraph_id": "P067", "field": "body", "index": 67, "text": "（永远保持清醒的话题意识，不要允许子女随便滑移话题）", "char_start": 2763, "char_end": 2789}, {"paragraph_id": "P068", "field": "body", "index": 68, "text": "—— 是没吃多少，我不太想吃。", "char_start": 2790, "char_end": 2805}, {"paragraph_id": "P069", "field": "body", "index": 69, "text": "—— 我可以做什么让你胃口好点吗？要不叫配点蕃茄酱或者煎个荷包蛋？", "char_start": 2807, "char_end": 2840}, {"paragraph_id": "P070", "field": "body", "index": 70, "text": "（永远从“基于对现状的接受，为改善现状提供帮助”的角度做第一反应。这要优先于一切其他反应）", "char_start": 2841, "char_end": 2886}, {"paragraph_id": "P071", "field": "body", "index": 71, "text": "—— 我想没有。", "char_start": 2887, "char_end": 2895}, {"paragraph_id": "P072", "field": "body", "index": 72, "text": "—— 你应该知道正餐的重要性吧？这是你预先知道的聚餐，你有机会建议菜谱，也有机会在这之前管理你的食欲，那么到了该吃的时候，你没有胃口，对做饭的人和同桌的人都是一种辜负，这不是一个纯只跟你想要什么有关的事。所以这是一个我们需要找到原因、防止再发生的问题。", "char_start": 2897, "char_end": 3023}, {"paragraph_id": "P073", "field": "body", "index": 73, "text": "现在时间有限，我们回头找时间讨论一下，看有什么措施可以避免这种情况反复出现，你回头告诉我你可以做这个讨论的时间，必须这个星期以内。", "char_start": 3024, "char_end": 3089}, {"paragraph_id": "P074", "field": "body", "index": 74, "text": "Siri，每天中午12点提醒我确认xxx有没有给出正餐问题的谈话时间。", "char_start": 3090, "char_end": 3125}, {"paragraph_id": "P075", "field": "body", "index": 75, "text": "（作出裁定，解释裁定的依据。裁定本身不容讨论，但可以挤出一点可以容ta选择的细节让ta决定。总是在不容选择之中尽量给出一些选择余地，可以大大的缓解子女的“绝对被动”感。也有利于避免绝对刚性碰撞。同时要当面采取措施，消灭子女一切“蒙混过关”的侥幸。）", "char_start": 3126, "char_end": 3250}, {"paragraph_id": "P076", "field": "body", "index": 76, "text": "你需不需要给你弄点干粮以防下午肚饿？", "char_start": 3251, "char_end": 3269}, {"paragraph_id": "P077", "field": "body", "index": 77, "text": "（基于对现状的进一步接受，提出补救性措施）", "char_start": 3270, "char_end": 3291}, {"paragraph_id": "P078", "field": "body", "index": 78, "text": "—— 不用了，我真的不饿。", "char_start": 3292, "char_end": 3305}, {"paragraph_id": "P079", "field": "body", "index": 79, "text": "—— 好，那你去吧。", "char_start": 3306, "char_end": 3316}, {"paragraph_id": "P080", "field": "body", "index": 80, "text": "注意上面这个处置和之前那个处置的差别：", "char_start": 3318, "char_end": 3337}, {"paragraph_id": "P081", "field": "body", "index": 81, "text": "1）这个处置没有否定子女拒绝的权利。实际上它毫不犹豫的接受了子女已经拒绝的事实。立刻把注意力转向如何在这个既成事实的基础上另作补救，而不是用各种手段迫使ta收回成命。", "char_start": 3338, "char_end": 3421}, {"paragraph_id": "P082", "field": "body", "index": 82, "text": "2）你没有卡住双方的行程。喋喋不休是要卡住双方的行程的，大有一种“你不答应别想完事”的意思。", "char_start": 3422, "char_end": 3468}, {"paragraph_id": "P083", "field": "body", "index": 83, "text": "但这本身就是在暗示自己是个没事做的闲人，屁大点事就有时间盯着不放，根本没有什么时间表需要遵守。同时还在假定对方肯定也是这种闲人，可以随时插入一段漫长的计划外对话。", "char_start": 3469, "char_end": 3550}, {"paragraph_id": "P084", "field": "body", "index": 84, "text": "这本身就是对自己和对方生命的双重不尊重。", "char_start": 3551, "char_end": 3571}, {"paragraph_id": "P085", "field": "body", "index": 85, "text": "你要像交警处理事故那样，你干脆利落的处置掉现场，记录案件后就立刻放行，不怕没时间从容处理。", "char_start": 3572, "char_end": 3617}, {"paragraph_id": "P086", "field": "body", "index": 86, "text": "这种对双方时间的尊重，本身就是对对方自尊的激励，自然引导对方以一个同样贵重的人的身份来和你严肃的处理这件事。", "char_start": 3618, "char_end": 3672}, {"paragraph_id": "P087", "field": "body", "index": 87, "text": "3）你严谨的处理了“这事可能不了了之”的可能性。", "char_start": 3674, "char_end": 3698}, {"paragraph_id": "P088", "field": "body", "index": 88, "text": "所谓的严肃性、权威性，从最基本的意义上就来自这个“绝不可能不了了之”的预期。这自然会迫使子女严肃的对待引起这种严肃对待的的事件本身。", "char_start": 3699, "char_end": 3765}, {"paragraph_id": "P089", "field": "body", "index": 89, "text": "这就像你酒驾意外，在还能私了的阶段，你都不以为意，要是真能私了了，没准你还会再犯。一旦被交警记录在案，给了你案件号了，要留下永久记录了，你就立刻不会再当这是玩笑了。", "char_start": 3766, "char_end": 3848}, {"paragraph_id": "P090", "field": "body", "index": 90, "text": "不要靠什么疾言厉色、声嘶力竭去“逼迫子女重视”，要靠真正的严肃。", "char_start": 3849, "char_end": 3881}, {"paragraph_id": "P091", "field": "body", "index": 91, "text": "话说到这里了，似乎正确的做法也示范了，但是作为父母，你们却并没有如释重负，不是吗？", "char_start": 3882, "char_end": 3923}, {"paragraph_id": "P092", "field": "body", "index": 92, "text": "因为你们虽然看到了这个问题的答案，但却发现这个答案太微妙了，背后的逻辑太复杂了。", "char_start": 3924, "char_end": 3964}, {"paragraph_id": "P093", "field": "body", "index": 93, "text": "就像高中生看了奥赛题的答案，直接看答案，可以赞叹解法的精妙，看了答案之后，也的确可以保证同样的这一题可以解得出，但是看完之后，却对数学绝望了。", "char_start": 3965, "char_end": 4036}, {"paragraph_id": "P094", "field": "body", "index": 94, "text": "因为这个比赛可不只有这一题啊。", "char_start": 4037, "char_end": 4052}, {"paragraph_id": "P095", "field": "body", "index": 95, "text": "看来题题都有如此的复杂微妙，我哪能题题都解得到这个地步呢？一共有一千题，这题我看着答案会了，下一题我上哪里去找答案提前学会呢？就算我好学，怕也是先遇上了问题，已经搞砸了，然后才会后知后觉的来问吧？那时候不也已经晚了吗？", "char_start": 4053, "char_end": 4162}, {"paragraph_id": "P096", "field": "body", "index": 96, "text": "这事其实分两层。", "char_start": 4163, "char_end": 4171}, {"paragraph_id": "P097", "field": "body", "index": 97, "text": "第一层，是你还是要积极学习。", "char_start": 4172, "char_end": 4186}, {"paragraph_id": "P098", "field": "body", "index": 98, "text": "现在你面前就有两个现成的资料可以立刻着手看起。一个是知乎这一份 家族答集，一个是我爱发电同名帐号内的内容。", "char_start": 4187, "char_end": 4240}, {"paragraph_id": "P099", "field": "body", "index": 99, "text": "这两个看完，你自然会发现很多基本原则，握住这个基本原则，你还是会犯错误，但是你犯错误的质量会有显著的提高，而且你往往更容易犯正确的错误而不是错误的错误。至于“正确的错误”是什么意思，你看完自然知道。", "char_start": 4241, "char_end": 4340}, {"paragraph_id": "P100", "field": "body", "index": 100, "text": "第二层，没有人可以做到绝对正确的教育，也没有任何一个成功的人是从所谓正确的教育里成长起来的。每一个成功的人都是从不尽正确的教育里“出淤泥而不染”，最后达成成就的，所以不必为你的教育不尽正确而过度焦虑。", "char_start": 4342, "char_end": 4442}, {"paragraph_id": "P101", "field": "body", "index": 101, "text": "你要追求的不是绝对正确，而是尽量正确。", "char_start": 4443, "char_end": 4462}, {"paragraph_id": "P102", "field": "body", "index": 102, "text": "这话比你想象的复杂——追求绝对正确的人，往往相信绝对正确是可能的，而自己哪怕还不算绝对正确，至少也是大半正确，只是不够完美罢了。而仅仅追求尽量正确的人，则首先承认绝对正确是不可能的。而且这种承认不是那种“整张卷子一百题，我只是没法做全对”的承认，而是“整张卷子一百题，每一题我都没法做全对”的承认。", "char_start": 4463, "char_end": 4612}, {"paragraph_id": "P103", "field": "body", "index": 103, "text": "你要放弃“我这么做是因为这么做我确信是对的”这样的行为风格，而要改用“我这么做并非因为我确信这是对的，而是这是我所知目前最不错的做法”的逻辑来驱动你的行为。", "char_start": 4613, "char_end": 4691}, {"paragraph_id": "P104", "field": "body", "index": 104, "text": "仅仅这一个转变，你还是会错，但因为你是抱着这个“并不自居掌握真理”的姿态犯的错，是基于“不得已”而不是“我是真理”而犯的错，你的错会被子女原谅。", "char_start": 4692, "char_end": 4764}, {"paragraph_id": "P105", "field": "body", "index": 105, "text": "你的错误，是在你“始终在尽力学习”的前提下，以“我知道不对，但不得已采用了我目前所知最不错的做法”的态度犯下的，你的错误里的“恶意”、“傲慢”的部分就极大的清除了。", "char_start": 4765, "char_end": 4847}, {"paragraph_id": "P106", "field": "body", "index": 106, "text": "没有这个毒，你的错就只会凝结出经验和教训，而不是待报复和惩罚的罪和仇恨。", "char_start": 4848, "char_end": 4884}, {"paragraph_id": "P107", "field": "body", "index": 107, "text": "重要的不是错不错，而是罪与仇。没有或少有罪与仇，错误也是祝福。", "char_start": 4885, "char_end": 4916}, {"paragraph_id": "P108", "field": "body", "index": 108, "text": "所以你们不必为“奥赛难度我达不到”而忧愁，看懂没有？", "char_start": 4917, "char_end": 4943}, {"paragraph_id": "P109", "field": "body", "index": 109, "text": "（待更新）", "char_start": 4944, "char_end": 4949}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 113, "quote": 6}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0381"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：我家孩子一直用一模一样的话回我，这是心理疾病吗？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036", "P037", "P038", "P039", "P040", "P041", "P042", "P043", "P044", "P045", "P046", "P047", "P048", "P049", "P050", "P051", "P052", "P053", "P054", "P055", "P056", "P057", "P058", "P059", "P060", "P061", "P062", "P063", "P064", "P065", "P066", "P067", "P068", "P069", "P070", "P071", "P072", "P073", "P074", "P075", "P076", "P077", "P078", "P079", "P080", "P081", "P082", "P083", "P084", "P085", "P086", "P087", "P088", "P089", "P090", "P091", "P092", "P093", "P094", "P095", "P096", "P097", "P098", "P099", "P100", "P101", "P102", "P103", "P104", "P105", "P106", "P107", "P108", "P109"], "summary": "围绕“牙关紧咬”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“对话分析什么的最萌了。我们来看看下面这个对话。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "对话分析什么的最萌了。我们来看看下面这个对话。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 23, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "96d4ec6b-de8d-5360-b119-426b6d47b614", "source_ordinal": 1448, "reading_ordinal": 2609, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "不理想的判决", "published_at": "2024-07-22T21:06:32+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/661943653/answer/3570170797"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "当你遇到你个人难以接受的合法判决，你有以下一些办法去做合法反应：", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 32}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "1）向人大代表请愿，推动修法提案。", "char_start": 33, "char_end": 50}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "2）参与公共讨论，呼吁修法。", "char_start": 51, "char_end": 65}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "3）向被告方提供法律援助。", "char_start": 66, "char_end": 79}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "4）向被告方作出私人捐助。", "char_start": 80, "char_end": 93}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "但是除非有什么确切的证据，你不能轻易的因为判决不符合你的预期而主张“判决不公”。", "char_start": 94, "char_end": 134}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "甚至即使你有什么确切的证据，你也只能呈现、提交这些证据，而不能自行宣判“判决不公”，这个是普通公民没有的权利。", "char_start": 135, "char_end": 190}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "前面那几条，都是你的合法权利，只能在这个范围内寻求改善现状和未来。", "char_start": 191, "char_end": 224}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "法律是注定不完美而稍稍落后于时代的，作为积极的公民，要学会在接受法律必然的时代局限的前提下良性的推动法律成熟，而不是一旦遇到这类问题就推翻司法结果，不承认法律的权威性。", "char_start": 225, "char_end": 309}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "有缺陷的法律也要比没有法律要好。", "char_start": 310, "char_end": 326}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 10}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0381"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：某网站因提供免费下载国家食品标准，被判赔 15 万，这个判罚合理吗？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010"], "summary": "围绕“不理想的判决”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“当你遇到你个人难以接受的合法判决，你有以下一些办法去做合法反应：”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "当你遇到你个人难以接受的合法判决，你有以下一些办法去做合法反应：", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 32, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "073568ea-eae9-52ef-861e-484476c0190c", "source_ordinal": 1447, "reading_ordinal": 2610, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "红拂夜奔", "published_at": "2024-07-22T21:14:26+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/661265989/answer/3570177603"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "很多这类问题问的所谓“怎么办”，言下之意是“怎么办就能拒绝这个条件而且还把婚结了”，而不是“怎么办才能平稳的接受结不了婚的现实”。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 65}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "一个更根本的问题是——该不该去追求“拒绝条件且把婚结了”这个结果？", "char_start": 66, "char_end": 99}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "追求到了这个结果，确定是“赚了”吗？", "char_start": 100, "char_end": 118}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "很显然这个结果即使追求成功，这个婚姻关系也是非常脆弱的，婚姻生活预期也是坎坷痛苦的。这就好像你要横渡太平洋，却选了一艘毛病很大的船出海。", "char_start": 119, "char_end": 187}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "海倒是出成了，但是你不怕在海中央船漏水、解体吗？", "char_start": 188, "char_end": 212}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "只有短暂临时的事可以勉强，因为这些事造成的后果是局部的、有限的，可以管控和填平的。", "char_start": 213, "char_end": 254}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "婚姻这种原则上要持续终身、而且必然影响子女终身的事，最好不要有一丁点勉强。", "char_start": 255, "char_end": 292}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "要横渡太平洋的船，性能如何可以再商量，在结实牢固程度上让你有任何顾虑，你都不要勉强为好。", "char_start": 293, "char_end": 337}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "实际上，反而是你提前就拿出这个“我绝不会勉强”的态度，有利于对方在开口要彩礼的时候仔细掂量，在你拒绝之后严肃纠结。", "char_start": 338, "char_end": 395}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "另外，很多关系都是谈到结婚条件问题的时候终结的。", "char_start": 396, "char_end": 420}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "其实我们再三讨论过这个问题——要跟那些“如果家里不同意只会断然选择跟你私奔”的人谈恋爱，不要跟那些“家里不同意就只能跟你分手”的人谈恋爱。", "char_start": 421, "char_end": 490}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "后者不叫“家庭关系亲密”，而叫做“并非真正的成年人”。", "char_start": 491, "char_end": 518}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "不要和未成年人谈恋爱，这是常识。", "char_start": 519, "char_end": 535}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "谈恋爱要找红拂、卓文君，不要找祝英台。", "char_start": 537, "char_end": 556}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "先能私奔，再谈结婚。", "char_start": 557, "char_end": 567}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 16}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0381"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：女朋友说，必须把我所有的存款存到她的卡上才跟我订婚，我不同意。现在处于即将分手的地步，我该怎么办？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015"], "summary": "围绕“红拂夜奔”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“很多这类问题问的所谓“怎么办”，言下之意是“怎么办就能拒绝这个条件而且还把婚结了”，而不是“怎么办才能平稳的接受结不了婚的现实”。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "很多这类问题问的所谓“怎么办”，言下之意是“怎么办就能拒绝这个条件而且还把婚结了”，而不是“怎么办才能平稳的接受结不了婚的现实”。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 65, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "cc432346-82c2-536c-bb75-07dd30cddc4c", "source_ordinal": 1446, "reading_ordinal": 2611, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "有似我者", "published_at": "2024-07-23T02:37:17+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/660457701/answer/3570374305"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "如果你是可以模仿的，那么为被模仿而焦虑是正常的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 24}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "问题是，为什么你是可以模仿的？", "char_start": 25, "char_end": 40}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "人的不可模仿性来自哪里？", "char_start": 41, "char_end": 53}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "是这样：", "char_start": 54, "char_end": 58}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "我的眉梢本来就上挑，所以我要画这个眉形，只需要简单的几笔；你不是这个眉形，你要强似，你就要修、要剃、要拔、要补，远比我要更麻烦。", "char_start": 59, "char_end": 123}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "我的肤色本来就是这种淡小麦色，所以我用这个绛红唇彩就刚刚好；你要用这个唇妆，你就需要先把肤色修掉。", "char_start": 124, "char_end": 173}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "我的眼角本来就是微向上挑，所以我才可以用这个眼线画法，画出这个猫一般的杏仁眼；你不是，你就还要先修低内眼角才能取得相近的效果。", "char_start": 174, "char_end": 237}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "如果我对我自己足够了解，是在我自身之上做最高效的修饰做出的一个自洽的构型，我就可以断言——世上能以这个成本和这个效率做到这个效果的，只有我一个人而已。", "char_start": 238, "char_end": 313}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "如果我的这个外在不仅仅只是这些眼角眉梢、肤面唇间，还有根植于我独有的记忆、独擅的专长、独占的资源的一颦一笑、行动坐卧、言谈举止、进退取舍……", "char_start": 314, "char_end": 384}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "那么要模仿这包含着无限“加密特性”的我，对于一个没有我的一切条件的人，就将是一个必须付出沉重代价才能企及的巨大困难。", "char_start": 385, "char_end": 443}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "我之于我，天上地下，唯我独尊。", "char_start": 444, "char_end": 459}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "所以学我者可生，但似我者必死。", "char_start": 460, "char_end": 475}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "在这样的设计之下，如果你没有我的独有条件，那么为了逼真的模仿我所付出的额外的成本会一天比一天的吞噬你的余力。随着你余力枯竭，你离我这个原版的距离自然而然会越来越远。", "char_start": 476, "char_end": 558}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "这就像某个想要模仿名人的特型演员，即使天生有八九分像，真要吃好这碗饭，也得要花上大价钱动刀、得要花上大量的时间去研究资料、去练习动作表情和小动作一样。", "char_start": 559, "char_end": 634}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "然而即便如此，如果真的和原版站在一起，原版想要做到难以被复刻也是轻而易举的。", "char_start": 635, "char_end": 673}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "影武者要坐在风林火山的旗下，必须世上先无信玄。", "char_start": 674, "char_end": 697}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "这是理所当然的。", "char_start": 698, "char_end": 706}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "如果你会恐惧有人能比你做成更好的你，那只有一个可能，那就是你现在引以为你的这个幻影，本来就不该是你的样子。", "char_start": 707, "char_end": 760}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "你在追求的是某个“流行的范本”，而别人比你离这个范本更近。那些喜欢这个范本的人喜欢的、爱的也并不是你，而是那个范本。", "char_start": 761, "char_end": 819}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "这样的“喜欢”不过是短暂的一瞬，因为那个范本随时会过时，而你也不可能无限的去支付每天强行把自己改造成这个范本的代价。尤其是，在贴近这个范本的竞争中，你总会发现比你更有优势的“天才”。", "char_start": 820, "char_end": 911}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "这只是尚不知自我为何物的肉泥们妄想依靠某个模子省去认识自我的苦工的偷懒。", "char_start": 912, "char_end": 948}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "为结果的不可持续而恐惧，为建立在这幻影上的那随时可能随之幻灭的“喜爱”“迷恋”而焦虑，只是这份偷懒的小聪明应分的惩罚罢了。", "char_start": 949, "char_end": 1010}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 22}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0381"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：模仿我的人变得越来越受欢迎怎么办？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022"], "summary": "围绕“有似我者”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“如果你是可以模仿的，那么为被模仿而焦虑是正常的。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "如果你是可以模仿的，那么为被模仿而焦虑是正常的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 24, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "ed3b3285-5e3f-5fce-ad0d-ed63ccc4e1d4", "source_ordinal": 1445, "reading_ordinal": 2612, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "本性善变", "published_at": "2024-07-23T07:13:35+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/27505220/answer/3570427077"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "说人是会变的，是指人的具体计划很容易变。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 20}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "说人本性难移，是指人的行为模式很不容易改变。", "char_start": 21, "char_end": 43}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "这并不矛盾。", "char_start": 44, "char_end": 50}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "例如有这么一个小球，在起伏不平的方形网格中按照一个极为简单的规则运动：", "char_start": 51, "char_end": 86}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "1）下一步总是移向身边最高的一格。", "char_start": 87, "char_end": 104}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "2）当身边最高的格子多于一个时，随机选择一格移动。", "char_start": 105, "char_end": 130}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "这个简单而不变的运动策略就相当于小球的“本性”，而你对小球的运动路线的预判可以视为小球的“计划”。", "char_start": 131, "char_end": 180}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "问题是，即使按照如此简单的规则，你也会发现小球的实际运动路线很可能与你想象的不同。", "char_start": 181, "char_end": 222}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "一来，地形在变，你对地形的认知和测量有误差。", "char_start": 223, "char_end": 245}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "二来，有“高度相同时随机移动”的规则增加随机扰动。", "char_start": 246, "char_end": 271}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "这样就轻松的实现了“本性难移”前提下的“善变”。", "char_start": 272, "char_end": 296}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "具体的人自然比这个极端简化的模型更加复杂——人的决策模型本身就会受到行为结果的反馈性影响，是一个自我干涉的、具有相当不可预测性的事物。", "char_start": 297, "char_end": 364}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "也就是这个“本性”的部分，都不能简单的看作是一个边界清晰的固体，而要看作一朵内核趋向坚实而边界渐渐稀薄的概率云。", "char_start": 365, "char_end": 421}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "这时候所谓的人性，大概是指整个行为模式里一些较为稳定的部分，例如“偏好快感”“偏好拥有更多可能性”“厌恶折磨”这一类。", "char_start": 422, "char_end": 481}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "这些底层的行为方式，如果发生了错乱，很容易导致人无法有效的生存，所以自然而然会比较稳定。", "char_start": 482, "char_end": 526}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "只是这部分的稳定，并不意味着人的具体决策必然可以被预测——尤其是长期的、准确的预测——罢了。", "char_start": 527, "char_end": 573}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 17}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0381"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：怎样理解“人都是会变的”和“江山易改本性难移”？？两者是否矛盾？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016"], "summary": "围绕“本性善变”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“说人是会变的，是指人的具体计划很容易变。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "说人是会变的，是指人的具体计划很容易变。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 20, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "4395dc76-4826-5778-824d-82c5f0de8350", "source_ordinal": 1444, "reading_ordinal": 2613, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "完美航空", "published_at": "2024-07-23T07:58:31+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/4c33a994488611ef963f52540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这与其说应该学习，不如说是需要适应。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 18}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "因为人接受这一点的主要过程并不是通过学习什么专业文献或者统计数据，而是靠不断的在“某人搞砸了，但人人都说人非圣贤孰能无过，没有让ta承担我觉得ta应该承担的全部责任，总是我们这些无辜的人一起替ta分担了大部分实际后果”这种令人沮丧的事实里适应出来的。", "char_start": 19, "char_end": 144}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "严格说肇事者就是ta，最多还应该延及那个负责检查ta工作的人，就ta们俩应该为火箭爆炸负责。", "char_start": 145, "char_end": 191}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "这两亿多美元的火箭成本就该ta们两个人全赔。", "char_start": 192, "char_end": 214}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "结果呢？这两个人只是被辞退而已，甚至辞退都没辞退，只是罚了点款，降了点级。我们其他人根本啥错也没犯，完美的执行了我们的工作，我们却要因为整个公司要承担这个损失而被减薪甚至被裁员。", "char_start": 215, "char_end": 304}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "看出问题来没有？", "char_start": 305, "char_end": 313}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "这个制度就是一个“接受了人的不完美”的制度，你通过自愿成为这个组织的一员，你将不由自主的通过这个默认的组织原则成为“接受人的不完美”的全体成员之一。", "char_start": 314, "char_end": 388}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "你不用“学习”，你只需要适应。", "char_start": 389, "char_end": 404}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "你肯定不服气——要不我自己创建一个新组织，这个组织实行完全的个人负责制，谁挖的坑谁填平、谁的娃哭了谁抱走。", "char_start": 405, "char_end": 458}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "然后你立刻会发现这样一个问题：你要招人来拧螺丝，拧螺丝的一问“拧错了导致火箭爆炸你要赔两亿美元”，对方就要问你“那我工资多少啊”。", "char_start": 459, "char_end": 524}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "“一个月五千。”", "char_start": 525, "char_end": 533}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "换你，你干吗？", "char_start": 534, "char_end": 541}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "这么大的风险，错了基本等于经济诛九族了，我都不贪心，要个一个月两万不过分吧？", "char_start": 542, "char_end": 580}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "拧螺丝的两万，画图纸的多少钱一个月？", "char_start": 581, "char_end": 599}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "隔壁容错航空成本是你完美航空的十分之一，你觉得客户会把发射订单发给谁？", "char_start": 600, "char_end": 635}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "这就是赤裸裸的自然法的决定，没人能抵抗。", "char_start": 636, "char_end": 656}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "要么你抱着“我才不要受牵连”的想法直接饿死，要么你放弃这个念头，接受这种“不公平”的“连坐法”，好歹有口饭吃。", "char_start": 657, "char_end": 712}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "看明白没有？", "char_start": 713, "char_end": 719}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "爱——这显然包括无条件的接受ta人的不完美，将整个制度建设设立在这个前提上——就是低成本、可行性的根源。", "char_start": 720, "char_end": 772}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "没有爱，你的成本轻松突破天际，得活活饿死。", "char_start": 773, "char_end": 794}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "如果你需要学习，这一篇就是你需要的全部学习资料。", "char_start": 795, "char_end": 819}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "看明白了，就只剩适应了。", "char_start": 820, "char_end": 832}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 22}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0381"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：「接受他人是不完美的」是否也需要学习？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022"], "summary": "围绕“完美航空”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这与其说应该学习，不如说是需要适应。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这与其说应该学习，不如说是需要适应。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 18, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "bda7d426-10ab-53ec-a200-1d7a0227fd69", "source_ordinal": 1443, "reading_ordinal": 2614, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "美式基础教育", "published_at": "2024-07-23T22:43:33+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/660997291/answer/3571384224"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "欧美早期会及早分流学生，给精英学生分配很好的师资和大量的资源培养，只不过这类精英学生数量较少而已。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 49}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "欧美大学主要靠世界各国的精英留学生加本土的精英学生支撑，法律、政治、商业、医学类科目则大量的保留给所谓的legacy学生。", "char_start": 50, "char_end": 111}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "自己本国的一般公立学校学生基本等于被放弃了。", "char_start": 112, "char_end": 134}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "这是西方国家在票选政治逻辑下保持政治传统稳定的特殊安排——这基本上保证了专业人士、政商精英大半都和原有的统治阶层有血缘关系或者赞助关系，花小钱就把平民的精英一部分纳入自己的序列而把另一部分塞进体育、演艺这类“非实权部门”。再剩下的那点精英几乎必然会融入地下秩序，成为各种帮派老大一类的人物，染上了一个黑底子，不再可能去从政了。", "char_start": 135, "char_end": 298}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "所以，欧美这个所谓的“平民快乐教育”根本就不是围绕“最佳教学效果”“最高成材率”目标做出的安排。", "char_start": 299, "char_end": 347}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "本质上它的首要任务是确保“野无遗才”，保证“农民军里没有认字识数的”。", "char_start": 348, "char_end": 383}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "这一策略相当奏效，结果就是美国的中下阶层阶层的政治常识极端幼稚，社会认识极为浅薄，连干黑帮都干不出名堂来，更谈不上自行组织参与社会博弈。并且在操作层面代表中下阶层的，只有出身耶鲁哈佛常春藤的“高级人才”，早已脱离群众甚至干脆就不是群众出身。公民反抗仅仅停留在“零元购”这种不痛不痒的级别，仅仅只提供“反抗感”，毫无真实的反抗力度，换取不到真正有效的社会地位的改善和社会权利的扩张。", "char_start": 384, "char_end": 574}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "美式教育的头号使命就是歪的，不是在服务于最大多数的人民，反而有意设计成了要令人民变成半文盲以免影响自己既有的残暴统治——一个现代化了的奴隶制。", "char_start": 575, "char_end": 646}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "这样一个“教育制度”，谁学谁就有背叛自己的民族、背叛自己的人民的历史责任。", "char_start": 647, "char_end": 684}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "这不是什么风格差异、优势借鉴问题，而是必须旗帜鲜明的加以摒弃，绝不能模仿的原则问题。", "char_start": 685, "char_end": 727}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 10}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0381"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：是中国的早期严抓教育，大学后自由发挥的教育模式好，还是国外的早期任由发挥，大学再严抓的教育模式好？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010"], "summary": "围绕“美式基础教育”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“欧美早期会及早分流学生，给精英学生分配很好的师资和大量的资源培养，只不过这类精英学生数量较少而已。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "欧美早期会及早分流学生，给精英学生分配很好的师资和大量的资源培养，只不过这类精英学生数量较少而已。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 49, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "801f20e6-6ad6-51a3-81c4-9b521ada7798", "source_ordinal": 1442, "reading_ordinal": 2615, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "我是学生", "published_at": "2024-07-24T06:37:58+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/657898757/answer/3571544253"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "比如你现在中了车祸，你“是学生”，你根本没赚钱，付不起医药费。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 31}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "那你是要就地等死吗？", "char_start": 32, "char_end": 42}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "相类似的还有一些自知非常需要我这些东西的学生读者，也在为了省下一个月45元人民币，宁可选择少看、晚看很多重要的内容。", "char_start": 43, "char_end": 101}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "这些东西背后可以避免的那些精神纠结、那些弯路、那些本可以避免的无谓的伤害，早解决一个月、早避开一个，不值45块钱吗？", "char_start": 102, "char_end": 160}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "如果是明知它的价值，还要选“省45”，你这其实是在选择亏损啊。", "char_start": 161, "char_end": 192}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "其实这倒是不难理解，年轻人脸皮薄，经常宁可忍受折磨、宁可错过爱情、亲情、友情，宁可犯错误，宁可人生绕弯路，也要避免求人，避免“乞讨”。", "char_start": 194, "char_end": 261}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "于是总是干出“欠了两万块，为了不跟父母开口，宁可zs”、“做错了一件事，为了不让父母知道，宁可借高利贷”、“得了重病，为了不给家里添麻烦，宁可熬进ICU”这一类的事来。", "char_start": 262, "char_end": 346}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "“脸皮薄”的原因也不复杂——最基本的往往是父母过多的强调了家庭困难，过多的向子女抱怨过“你花了太多钱，却不知道珍惜”。", "char_start": 347, "char_end": 406}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "花了家里的钱，会有巨大的附加负罪感。花了这么多，已经快变成父母一切苦难的总根源了，为这已经被骂了、嫌了千万遍了。", "char_start": 407, "char_end": 463}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "所以哪怕是去死，也不要再多花一块了。", "char_start": 464, "char_end": 482}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "这可以理解，真的，完全可以理解。", "char_start": 483, "char_end": 499}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "但是这仍然很愚蠢。", "char_start": 500, "char_end": 509}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "危及生命、危及前途，就算你是学生，你没钱，你也要果断的叫救护车、果断的去医院。", "char_start": 511, "char_end": 550}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "就算挨骂、就算“丢脸”，就算“屈辱”，你也要果断的叫救护车、果断的去医院。", "char_start": 551, "char_end": 588}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "这tm的是生与死的问题，不是面子问题。", "char_start": 589, "char_end": 608}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "是赤裸裸的赚和赔的问题，不是面子问题。", "char_start": 609, "char_end": 628}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "你爹妈天天骂你花钱，真的遇到这种事，让ta们知道你打死也不开口，宁可苦熬，ta们更可能狂怒痛骂你，而不是赞赏你“懂事”。", "char_start": 629, "char_end": 689}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "因为你这是从根上危害ta们持续几十年的投资成果。", "char_start": 690, "char_end": 714}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "分清楚轻重。", "char_start": 715, "char_end": 721}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 21}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0381"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：谁能救救我，强迫症太严重了，心理咨询都是大几百一次，我是学生负担不起，有没有便宜一点的?；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019"], "summary": "围绕“我是学生”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“比如你现在中了车祸，你“是学生”，你根本没赚钱，付不起医药费。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "比如你现在中了车祸，你“是学生”，你根本没赚钱，付不起医药费。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 31, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
